OL,4,CF1 full-time race stewards 2027      W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GFormula 1's governing body the FIA   W5
OL,7,Gis to introduce permanent race       W5
OL,8,Gstewards from the 2027 season.       W5
OL,9,                                      W5
OL,10,GThe move follows consistent calls    W5
OL,11,Gfrom grand prix drivers for the      W5
OL,12,Gchange because of criticisms of      W5
OL,13,Ginconsistency of decisions regarding W5
OL,14,Gpenalties for on-track incidents.    W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GThe FIA said in a statement that it  W5
OL,17,Gwould begin recruiting permanent     W5
OL,18,Gstewards, and was planning a "phased W5
OL,19,Gintroduction" during the 2027 season.W5
